Package: com.fluoxetine.luros.dev.preferences
Name: Luros Preference Bundle Development
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Settings pane templates for Luros, for @FLAVOR@ jailbreaks
 Lets Luros create, build and package preference bundles on the device: a
 template with a switch and a text field, the PreferenceLoader entry that
 shows it in Settings, and declarations for the private Preferences
 framework. Needs PreferenceLoader, which your preferred package manager
 installs with it.
